ey encounter a case that is perfect for the master of the shop.\n\n\n\nEventually, Watanuki receives a visit from Doumeki's grandfather, Haruka. He requests that Watanuki investigates his grandson's dreams. While inside the dream world, he discovers how their past adventures played out from Doumeki's perspective of view, leading Watanuki to discover truths from 10 years ago and secrets about the ties that bind their friendship.\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["×××HOLiC・籠",""]},"kodikRevisions":{"serial-12136":"2026-03-27T17:51:25Z","serial-24278":"2026-03-27T17:51:17Z","serial-61665":"2024-09-23T00:52:22Z","movie-27075":"2020-01-21T00:17:53Z"},"kodikIds":["serial-12136","serial-24278","serial-61665","movie-27075"],"relatedMalIds":[4918],"rating":8.18,"relations":[{"id":4918,"relation":"prequel"}],"availableEpisodeCount":3}]}